&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CoreWeave’s Monolith team is building the essential cloud platform for AI innovators, applying machine learning to solve previously intractable physics and engineering challenges. We operate at the intersection of advanced cloud infrastructure and applied data science, transforming how complex industrial products - such as automotive systems, aircraft, and advanced batteries - are conceived, tested, and developed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Product Manager, you will own the vision, strategy, and roadmap for one of the core components of our platform. We&#39;re rebuilding the platform from the ground up, so you&#39;ll shape the product from day one. You&#39;ll drive execution across Research, Data Science, and Forward Deployed Engineering to ship features that span agentic experiences to enterprise integrations. You will work closely with enterprise customers to understand complex engineering workflows, turn field signals into platform improvements, and mentor other product managers across the organisation while setting a high bar for technical depth and customer empathy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of product management experience with a strong track record working on complex, data-driven products and enterprise systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High versatility with a proven ability to work across multiple technical domains (e.g., ML modelling, agentic workflows, cloud infrastructure, or data engineering).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency with the ability to confidently discuss APIs, architecture diagrams, deployment models, and platform trade-offs with engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated cross-functional leadership, skilled at aligning diverse teams, managing technical dependencies, and balancing constraints with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep customer empathy with a curiosity for diagnosing friction points for both external engineering users and internal forward-deployed teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Absolute execution focus with a proven ability to build clarity out of ambiguity, maintain high attention to detail, and drive initiatives from concept through delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in engineering, physical research, or applied data science (e.g., hands-on experience running physical tests, analysing sensor data, or working in a lab environment).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud infrastructure platforms such as AWS, GCP, Azure, or CoreWeave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI-assisted coding tools; our PMs are builders first and regularly ship code to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you&#39;re a good fit?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we&#39;ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we&#39;d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You love to&lt;/strong&gt; build clarity out of complexity and champion high-impact technical products from concept to launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re curious about&lt;/strong&gt; emerging Physical AI technologies, agentic workflows, and how they can be applied to transform real-world industrial challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re an expert in&lt;/strong&gt; cross-functional execution, seamlessly connecting the dots between deeply technical engineering teams and commercial priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast! We&#39;re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We&#39;re not afraid of a little chaos, and we&#39;re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and enables the development of innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for takeoff, the organisation&#39;s growth opportunities are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To fulfill our obligation to protect client data, successful applicants offered employment with CoreWeave will be required to complete a basic criminal record check, conducted in compliance with GDPR. Employment offers are conditional upon receiving satisfactory check results&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
