&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about distributed systems failure modes, GPU performance pathologies, and reliability engineering at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re excited by the idea of moving from anomaly detection to prediction to autonomous root cause reasoning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy designing platforms that protect uptime, revenue, and customer trust through proactive systems thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
